{"2849990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Auto Dungeon", "steam_appid": 2849990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Astral Plane awaits you, <i><strong>Summoner</strong></i><strong>.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a vast, procedurally generated world. Summon and command your army of diverse creatures to battle fearsome foes and cunning rival summoners. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras/1e88acacb871b1bb89faef9ea94046b3.avif?t=1776389039\" width=800 height=960 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of card collection and strategic play. Unleash a myriad of game-altering effects, from capturing enemy creatures, to fusing your minions together and imbuing them with synergistic traits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against five formidable champions in your quest to reclaim the mystical rings they've plundered. Each victory brings you closer to ultimate power and conquering the Astral Plane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge unstoppable warriors. Equip, enchant, combine, and mutate your creatures to create terrifyingly powerful amalgamations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras/3740fcbf29442932e21d183639444c3f.avif?t=1776389039\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras_big/3740fcbf29442932e21d183639444c3f.avif?t=1776389039 width=800 height=285 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all of this, you will form an army that tests the limits of this realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >See you in the Astral Plane, <strong><i>Summoner</i></strong><i>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras/09ceef25b942a9000dff2d520daa9528.poster.avif?t=1776389039\" width=600 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras/09ceef25b942a9000dff2d520daa9528.webm?t=1776389039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras/09ceef25b942a9000dff2d520daa9528.mp4?t=1776389039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Astral Plane awaits you, <i><strong>Summoner</strong></i><strong>.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a vast, procedurally generated world. Summon and command your army of diverse creatures to battle fearsome foes and cunning rival summoners. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849990/extras/1e88acacb871b1bb89faef9ea94046b3.avif?t=1776389039\" width=800 height=960 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of card collection and strategic play. Unleash a myriad of game-altering effects, from capturing enemy creatures, to fusing your minions together and imbuing them with synergistic traits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against five formidable champions in your quest to reclaim the mystical rings they've plundered. Each victory brings you closer to ultimate power and conquering the Astral Plane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge unstoppable warriors. Equip, enchant, combine, and mutate your creatures to create terrifyingly powerful amalgamations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragra